---
// src/components/sections/IntroSection.astro
---

<section
	id="readme"
	class="border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/30 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-md scroll-mt-16 relative flex flex-col lg:block overflow-hidden min-h-fit lg:min-h-[360px] rigid-card system-card"
>
	<!-- Card Header Workspace Controllers -->
	<div
		class="flex items-center justify-between -mx-6 sm:-mx-8 -mt-6 sm:-mt-8 px-6 sm:px-8 pt-4 pb-3 mb-6 bg-neutral-950/65 [.light_&]:bg-[#EBE7DC]/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-neutral-800/60 font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-400 relative z-20"
	>
		<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
			<svg
				xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
				width="11"
				height="11"
				viewBox="0 0 24 24"
				fill="none"
				stroke="currentColor"
				stroke-width="2.5"
				stroke-linecap="round"
				stroke-linejoin="round"
				class="text-amber-500/90"
			>
				<path
					d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"
				></path>
				<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
			</svg>
			<span class="terminal-path">~/system_config/readme.txt</span>
		</div>
		<span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-900/70 border border-neutral-800/80 text-[9px] text-neutral-400">[AUTHOR_INFO]</span>
	</div>

	<!-- Left-Side Portrait Subsystem: Seamless CSS alpha-mask bleed into any card theme/hover state -->
	<div
		id="bio-portrait-layer"
		class="hidden lg:block lg:absolute lg:left-0 lg:top-0 lg:h-full lg:w-[310px] pointer-events-none select-none z-0 bio-portrait-mask"
	>
		<img
			src="/profile.jpg"
			alt="Gerard Dominic Baldo"
			width="620"
			height="720"
			class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top brightness-[1.02] contrast-[1.02]"
			id="bio-portrait-img"
		/>
	</div>

	<!-- Content Layer -->
	<div
		id="bio-content-layer"
		class="relative z-10 w-full lg:pl-[288px] flex flex-col h-full justify-between gap-5"
	>
		<!-- Profile Metadata -->
		<div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
			<div class="flex-1">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 text-emerald-400 [.light_&]:text-emerald-800 [.light_&]:bg-emerald-600/10 [.light_&]:border-emerald-600/30 font-mono text-[10px] mb-2">
					<span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
					<span>AVAILABLE FOR ENGINEERING ROLES</span>
				</div>
				<h2
					class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-100 tracking-tight"
				>
					Gerard Dominic Baldo
				</h2>
				<p
					class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1"
				>
					// System-First Engineer
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 mt-2.5 font-mono text-[10px]">
					<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-950/50 border border-neutral-800/80 text-neutral-300">Vue.js</span>
					<span class="text-neutral-600">//</span>
					<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-950/50 border border-neutral-800/80 text-neutral-300">PHP Laravel</span>
					<span class="text-neutral-600">//</span>
					<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-950/50 border border-neutral-800/80 text-neutral-300">Astro Architecture</span>
					<span class="text-neutral-600">//</span>
					<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-950/50 border border-neutral-800/80 text-neutral-300">QA & E2E</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Mobile-only premium avatar -->
			<div
				class="lg:hidden flex-shrink-0 relative select-none pointer-events-none"
			>
				<div
					class="relative w-20 h-20 aspect-square rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/40 p-1"
				>
					<div
						class="w-full h-full rounded-md overflow-hidden relative"
					>
						<img
							src="/profile.jpg"
							alt="Gerard Dominic Baldo"
							width="160"
							height="160"
							class="w-full h-full aspect-square object-cover object-top brightness-[1.02]"
						/>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Micro-Status Indicator badge -->
				<span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
					<span
						class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"
					></span>
					<span
						class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-emerald-500"
					></span>
				</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Layout Divider -->
		<div
			id="bio-divider"
			class="w-full h-[1px] bg-neutral-800/70"
		>
		</div>

		<!-- Biography Processing Blocks -->
		<div
			id="bio-text-grid"
			class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 font-normal"
		>
			<p>
				Hey, I'm Gerard. You could call me a nerd or whatever, but I've
				just always had this thing for computers and figuring out how
				they actually work. When I build something, whether I'm using
				Vue.js, Laravel, or Astro, I care a lot about doing it the right
				way. I like making sure the foundation is solid instead of just
				hacking things together. I'm constantly turning problems over in
				my head, I'm that guy who steps away from the keyboard and
				suddenly figures out the solution to a bug out of nowhere. I
				just like doing things right, and doing them smart. Lately, I’ve
				also been doing some QA work, and honestly, intentionally trying
				to break other people's code is a blast. It feels a little evil,
				sure, but finding exactly where a system cracks is a massive
				perk—and it honestly just makes me build my own stuff even
				tighter.
			</p>
			<div
				class="border-l-2 border-amber-500/40 pl-3.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono italic"
			>
				~ When I need to step away and clear my head, I completely
				disconnect. I spend most of my free time taking walks, admiring
				the scenery, and just taking pictures wherever I happen to go.
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
